。四年，齊髙偃如晉，請共伐燕，入其君。晉平公許，與齊伐燕，入惠公。惠公至燕而死。"}],"rationale":"依周初封建、燕君世系、割地救燕、讓國及秦滅諸國的具體語境暫定異稱。繼位不自動證父子；同爵者分國別與前後世代。太子平／燕昭王依本篇明示，不表示年代及世系已校定。作君奭為書名，君奭不説之君奭才暫解召公稱呼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p013","text":"惠公元年，齊髙止來奔。六年，惠公多寵姬，公欲去諸大夫而立寵姬宋，大夫共誅姬宋，惠公懼，奔齊。四年，齊髙偃如晉，請共伐燕，入其君。晉平公許，與齊伐燕，入惠公。惠公至燕而死。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"1pc_mnq_z0c_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"齊髙止","kind":"person","person_id":"jug_ktd_id2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"1pc_mnq_z0c_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"寵姬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"諸大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"姬宋","kind":"person","person_id":"883_auv_cl0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"姬宋","kind":"person","person_id":"883_auv_cl0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0039","start":39,"end":41,"surface":"惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"1pc_mnq_z0c_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m013-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"齊髙偃","kind":"person","person_id":"sd8_6xr_wgg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-y